$articles=@(@('article-seo.html','A Practical Starting Point for SEO','SEO','Search visibility is built through connected decisions. Begin by understanding what your audience is looking for and how your site helps them.',@(@('Start with search intent','List the questions customers ask before choosing a product or service. Group related questions and map them to useful pages.'),@('Make the page useful','Use a specific title, clear main heading, concise explanations, and helpful next steps. Add internal links for readers.'),@('Check technical basics','Make sure important pages are reachable, work well on mobile, and use descriptive links. Review indexing and performance data.'),@('Treat SEO as ongoing learning','Compare relevant queries over time. Keep useful content current and use evidence to decide what to improve.'))),@('article-social.html','Plan Social Content with Purpose','Social media','A useful social plan gives a business a repeatable way to share its perspective without turning every week into a scramble.',@(@('Choose a few content themes','Themes can reflect customer questions, product knowledge, behind-the-scenes work, or the people and values behind a brand.'),@('Match formats to the idea','Short video, carousels, photos, and text posts each do different jobs. Choose formats your team can create consistently.'),@('Build a realistic rhythm','Plan around available time and resources. A calendar should make publishing easier while leaving room to learn.'),@('Review and refine','Look at saves, replies, clicks, and other relevant signals in context. Use patterns to inform the next cycle.'))),@('article-landing.html','Make Your Landing Page Clearer','Website development','A landing page works best when visitors quickly understand the offer, who it is for, and what to do next.',@(@('Lead with the value','Use a clear headline and supporting description that explain the offer. Keep one primary action easy to find.'),@('Answer useful questions','Explain what is included, who benefits, and what happens after someone reaches out.'),@('Reduce friction','Make the layout easy to scan, ask only relevant form questions, and check the experience on a phone.'),@('Learn from real behavior','Use an appropriate analytics setup to understand engagement. Treat improvements as hypotheses to review.'))))
